            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I tested it with python and it is working. This is very strange 🤯. Here is the current behavior with my setup:\r\n\r\n- setup `@class.outer` with `custom_textobjects` in `mini.ai`\r\n  - it works in python but not in typescript\r\n- set it up with `nvim-treesitter-textobjects`, it works for both\r\n\r\nCan you clone [this](https://github.com/shashanktomar/ts-cdk-monorepo) small `typescript` project. Go to `sqs-sourced-function.ts` and try it inside the class block? For this scenario, it works for me with `nvim-treesitter-textobjects` mapping but not with `custom_textobjects`",
